  "bio": "Moni, an adept tattoo artist based in St. Gallen, Switzerland, is renowned for their proficiency in a range of styles including floral, geometric, and tribal tattoos. Operating out of AXIS MUNDI TAETOWIERUNGEN, Moni's work is characterized by a meticulous blend of artistry and cleanliness, ensuring each client leaves with a pristine and beautifully crafted piece. Their unwavering attention to hygiene sets the standard for a safe and professional tattooing experience.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: St Gallen, St Gallen, Switzerland",
